# Video demo on Elementor PRs (editor bugs only)

Before `gh pr create` or `gh pr edit` on `elementor/elementor` or
`elementor/elementor-pro`, read [SKILL.md](mdc:.cursor/skills/video-proof-demo/SKILL.md)
and author `## Video demo`. Applies to `/pr`, `create-ship-deploy`, Cloud
Agents, and manual PR creation.

- Order: `## Summary` → `## Test plan` → `## Video demo` → `## Jira`
- **Record now:** Jira `Bug` whose user-visible surface is the Elementor
  editor and which can run on Core Playground. One Where / Steps / Pass /
  Fail block plus `**Broken:**` (caption only — do not act out the bug)
- **Everyone else:** keep the heading with `#skip_video` + one sentence
- Never leave placeholders; never ask the user to write the section
- Steps use visible in-app labels only

The `## Video demo` section is read by the recorder against
`playground-preview`. Write it for that runner, not for human reviewers.
